# File Length Limit

Keep files under 400 lines.

## Requirement

- Do not create or expand files beyond 400 lines.
- If a file approaches this limit, split logic into focused modules.

## Preferred Refactors

- Extract helper functions to `*_utils` files.
- Move domain logic into service or processor modules.
- Split large classes into smaller classes with one responsibility.

## Example

```python
# Instead of one large monolithic file:
# monolithic_data_processor.py (520 lines)  # ❌

# Split into focused modules:               # ✅
# data_loader.py
# data_transformer.py
# data_validator.py
# report_generator.py
```
